express to major US metros and 5–7 business days to all 50 states, with gift combos, designer rakhis, and Bhaiya Bhabhi sets.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does UsaRakhi ship from within the USA like FNP or IGP?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. UsaRakhi uses domestic US fulfillment. Sisters order from India, UK, Canada, or anywhere worldwide; we ship inside America so your brother avoids international customs delays — the same peace-of-mind advantage as top USA-focused Rakhi brands.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does Rakhi delivery take in the USA?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Express delivery in 2–3 business days to major US metros (New York, Los Angeles, Chicago, Houston, San Francisco, New Jersey). Nationwide delivery to all 50 states in 5–7 business days. Same-day dispatch on most orders before our daily cut-off.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When should I order for Raksha Bandhan 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Raksha Bandhan 2026 is August 28, 2026. Order today for express delivery to major US cities to avoid the last-minute rush and ensure your Rakhi reaches the USA on time.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I send Rakhi from India to the USA?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We accept orders from India, UK, Canada, Australia, and anywhere worldwide. Enter the US delivery address at checkout and we ship domestically within America.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I send Rakhi with chocolates and gift combos to the USA?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We offer Rakhi combos with Ferrero Rocher, Lindt, Hershey's chocolates, designer rakhis, and traditional sets with roli chawal — beautifully packed and delivered together.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you sell Rakhi hampers with sweets and dry fruits for USA delivery?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Our Rakhi Hamper collection includes complete gift boxes with designer rakhis, kaju katli, besan laddoo, soan papdi, cashews, almonds, pistachios, and festive packaging — shipped domestically across all 50 US states.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you offer Bhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi sets?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Our Bhaiya Bhabhi collection features elegant matching sets for brothers and sisters-in-law, including Lumba rakhis.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is included with Single Rakhi orders?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most single rakhis include complimentary roli (kumkum) and chawal (rice) for the traditional Raksha Bandhan tilak ceremony.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you deliver to California, New York, and Texas?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We deliver to all 50 US states including California, New York, Texas, Florida, New Jersey, Illinois, and every other state.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I trust UsaRakhi for USA Rakhi delivery?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. UsaRakhi is built around Rakhi and Raksha Bandhan traditions — 126+ premium designs, California warehouse fulfillment, and domestic shipping within America (no customs delays). We offer secure Stripe and Razorpay checkout, WhatsApp support, and a satisfaction guarantee. Read customer stories at usarakhi.com/reviews or contact us before ordering.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What payment methods do you accept?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Stripe (USD — Visa, Mastercard, Amex) and Razorpay (INR — UPI, cards, netbanking) for secure online checkout.\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$25\"}}],\"$L26\"],\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\",\"$L2b\",\"$L