ium spiritual Rakhi delivered across America.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's Included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n\n  \u003cli\u003e1 Designer Om Symbol Single Rakhi\u003c/li\u003e\n\n  \n\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp\u003eAll the listed items are carefully packed together in one elegant Rakhi gift package. The premium packaging ensures your Rakhi arrives safely, making it easy to celebrate Raksha Bandhan with your loved ones living in the USA.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy families choose this Rakhi for USA delivery:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n\n  \u003cli\u003ePremium Om Symbol designer Rakhi with Rudraksha beads\u003c/li\u003e\n\n  \u003cli\u003e for Raksha Bandhan \u003c/li\u003e\n\n  \u003cli\u003eFast domestic USA shipping with no international customs delays\u003c/li\u003e\n\n  \u003cli\u003eBeautiful festive packaging, ready for gifting\u003c/li\u003e\n\n  \u003cli\u003eSecure checkout in USD (Stripe) and INR (Razorpay)\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp\u003eLooking for more options? Browse our \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-combo-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Combos\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/single-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eSingle Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/kids-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eKids Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Sets\u003c/a\u003e, or explore our \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-hampers-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Hampers\u003c/a\u003e. You can also read our guide: \u003ca href=\"/blog/rakhi-hamper-gift-box-usa\"\u003eHow to Choose the Perfect Rakhi Gift Box for USA\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSKU:\u003c/strong\u003e TFPRD00312\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"single-rakhi\",{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between mb-5\",\"chil