a deep blue sapphire-style stone and delicate pearls that create a royal and festive look. The elegant combination of sparkling blue stonework and graceful pearls gives this rakhi a classy and traditional charm, making it a perfect choice for Raksha Bandhan celebrations . Designed especially for brothers who appreciate stylish and sophisticated accessories, this rakhi symbolizes love, protection, trust, and the everlasting bond between brother and sister. Its premium craftsmanship and attractive design make it a memorable expression of affection and blessings. Celebrate Raksha Bandhan with this elegant Rakhi for Brother and make your festive moments even more special and meaningful.\",\"price\":9.19,\"sku\":\"RK-03\",\"storefrontPricingApplied\":true,\"allowsAddons\":true}}],[\"$\",\"$L3f\",\"classic-maroon-designer-single-rakhi\",{\"product\":{\"seoTitle\":\"Send Classic Maroon Designer Single Rakhi to USA | Free Shipping | UsaRakhi\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"published\":true,\"lengthIn\":8,\"weightOz\":6,\"GSI1SK\":\"PRODUCT#classic-maroon-designer-single-rakhi\",\"name\":\"Classic Maroon Designer Single Rakhi\",\"SK\":\"META\",\"tags\":[\"single-rakhi\",\"designer-rakhi\",\"raksha-bandhan\",\"send-rakhi-to-usa\",\"inventory-2\",\"single-rakhi-thread\"],\"categorySlug\":\"single-rakhi\",\"widthIn\":6,\"inventory\":500,\"slug\":\"classic-maroon-designer-single-rakhi\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-29T05:07:33.533Z\",\"unitsSold\":1,\"heightIn\":2,\"GSI1PK\":\"CATEGORY#single-rakhi\",\"seoDescription\":\"Send Classic Maroon Designer Single Rakhi to USA — Rakhi hamper gift box with Designer 1 designer Single Rakhi, Roli, Chawal.\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-14T14:21:41.041Z\",\"images\":[\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/orange-county/TFPRD00312/TFPRD00312a.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/orange-county/TFPRD00312/TFPRD00312.jpg\"],\"compareAtPrice\":19.5,\"PK\":\"PRODUCT#classic-maroon-designer-single-rakhi\",\"description\":\"$49\",\"price\":15.6,\"sku\":\"TFPRD00312\",\"inventoryBatch\":\"inventory-2\",\"allowsAddons\":false}}],\"$L4a\",\"$L4b\",\"$L4c\",\"$L4d\",\"$L4e\",\"$L4f\",\"$L50\",\"$L51\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"52:T143f,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElegant Bhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Set with Designer Beaded Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e is a beautiful and traditional \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi set for Brother and Bhabhi\u003c/strong\u003e, thoughtfully designed to celebrate the special bond of Raksha Bandhan. This festive set features two elegant maroon designer Rakhis with intricate golden and sparkling stone-style detailing, along with two beautiful aqua blue beaded Rakhis featuring pearl-style beads and golden accents. The combination of rich colors, delicate beadwork, and traditional designs makes this a graceful Raksha Bandhan gift for both bhaiya and bhabhi.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003emaroon designer Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e feature an elegant elongated design decorated with multiple golden beads and beautiful floral-style stone embellishments. Each decorative section includes sparkling details with a central clear stone-style accent, creating a sophisticated and festive appearance. The rich maroon thread beautifully complements the golden embellishments and gives these Rakhis a traditional yet luxurious look.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eaqua blue beaded Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e offer a fresh and elegant contrast to the maroon designs. They feature beautiful aqua blue beads arranged with small golden and decorative separators, complemented by delicate white pearl-style beads. The soft aqua thread and coordinated beadwork create a graceful and stylish appearance, making these Rakhis suitable for a modern Raksha Bandhan celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe combination of maroon, aqua blue, gold, and pearl-style detailing gives this Rakhi set a coordinated and festive appearance. The set includes matching designs that allow both brother and bhabhi to be part of the Raksha Bandhan celebration. The detailed embellishments and elegant beadwork make this a thoughtful choice for sisters looking for a \u003cstrong\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi set\u003c/strong\u003e for USA delivery.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis Rakhi set also includes \u003cstrong\u003eRoli and Chawal\u003c/strong\u003e, traditional essentials used during the Raksha Bandhan ceremony. Roli is used for applying the traditional tilak, while Chawal (rice) is used as part of the traditional blessing ritual. Including these essentials makes it convenient to perform the Rakhi ceremony while keeping the traditional customs of Raksha Bandhan at the heart of the celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's included in this Rakhi set:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Maroon Designer Rakhis\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Aqua Blue Beaded Rakhis\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Roli\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Chawal (Rice)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eEvery item listed above is included in this festive Raksha Bandhan set, making it convenient to celebrate the occasion with your brother and bhabhi. The maroon designer Rakhis, aqua blue beaded Rakhis, and traditional Roli Chawal come together to create a beautiful combination of traditional style, elegant detailing, and festive charm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe maroon Rakhis add a rich and traditional touch with their intricate golden beadwork and sparkling floral-style embellishments. Their elongated decorative design creates an elegant appearance that can complement traditional festive clothing. The aqua blue Rakhis bring a softer and more contemporary look with their smooth blue beads, pearl-style accents, and golden separators.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eRaksha Bandhan is a special occasion to celebrate love, family, and the meaningful relationships shared between siblings and their families. This \u003cstrong\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi set\u003c/strong\u003e provides a beautiful way to include both your brother and bhabhi in the celebration. The coordinated designs make the set feel complete while giving each Rakhi its own distinctive style.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe detailed golden embellishments on the maroon Rakhis and the blue and pearl-style beads on the aqua Rakhis create a balanced combination of traditional and modern festive aesthetics. Whether your family prefers classic Rakhi designs or contemporary beaded styles, this set brings both looks together in one beautiful Raksha Bandhan collection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIf your brother and bhabhi live in the United States, this ready-to-gift \u003cstrong\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi set for USA delivery\u003c/strong\u003e is a convenient way to send your love and Raksha Bandhan wishes from far away. The set includes multiple beautifully coordinated Rakhis along with Roli and Chawal, making it easy to send a complete festive Raksha Bandhan gift.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you are celebrating Raksha Bandhan together with your family or sending your festive wishes from another country, this \u003cstrong\u003eElegant Bhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Set with Designer Beaded Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e is a thoughtful choice. The rich maroon designs, graceful aqua blue beadwork, golden accents, and traditional ceremony essentials come together to create a memorable Raksha Bandhan gift for bhaiya and bhabhi.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eLooking for more options? Explore our \u003ca href=\"/bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Sets\u003c/a\u003e, browse our \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-combo-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Combos\u003c/a\u003e with chocolates, discover our \u003ca href=\"/single-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eSingle Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e designs, explore our \u003ca href=\"/kids-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eKids Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e collection, or shop our complete \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-hampers-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Hampers\u003c/a\u003e for USA delivery.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2e:[\"$\",\"section\",\"rakhi-combo\",{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between mb-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-primary capitalize\",\"children\":\"Rakhi Combo To USA\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"href\":\"/rakhi-combo-to-usa\",\"className\":\"text-nav font-semibold text-sm hover:underline\",\"children\":\"View All →\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-5 gap-4 items-stretch\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3f\",\"om-pearl-single-rakhi-combo\",{\"product\":{\"seoTitle\":\"Om Rakhi \u0026 Pearl Single Rakhi Combo $6.99 | UsaRakhi USA\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"published\":true,\"lengthIn\":1,\"weightOz\":12,\"GSI1SK\":\"PRODUCT#om-pearl-single-rakhi-combo\",\"name\":\"Om Rakhi \u0026 Pearl Single Rakhi Combo\",\"SK\":\"META\",\"tags\":[\"fixed-price\",\"combo\",\"fast-selling\"],\"categorySlug\":\"rakhi-combo\",\"widthIn\":1,\"inventory\":194,\"slug\":\"om-pearl-single-rakhi-combo\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-05T05:22:33.181Z\",\"unitsSold\":34,\"heightIn\":1,\"GSI1PK\":\"CATEGORY#rakhi-combo\",\"seoDescription\":\"Shop the Om Rakhi and Pearl Single Rakhi combo for $6.99. Two rakhis with roli chawal — fast USA delivery from UsaRakhi.\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-16T04:25:52.325Z\",\"images\":[\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-06-at-10.36.39-PM-2.jpeg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/2026/03/pearl-single-rakhi-e1779467005952.webp\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/39239027-c8f8-4883-bee3-8805409d45e1.jpeg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/06f2f390-ae1c-4959-8547-39f20bf8b5d8.jpeg\"],\"compa