and attractive patterns, this set adds charm, tradition, and elegance to your festive celebration. Perfect for sending rakhi to USA , this thoughtfully curated combo blends classic and modern design, making it an ideal festive accessory to express your heartfelt emotions across distances. Crafted from premium-quality materials, both rakhis are comfortable to wear and designed for a graceful and festive look. This set also includes traditional roli and chawal , ensuring your Raksha Bandhan rituals are complete and convenient. A perfect way to express love, respect, and togetherness for both bhaiya and bhabhi.\",\"price\":34.32,\"sku\":\"HER-RK-10-15\",\"tags\":[\"bhaiya bhabhi rakhi set\",\"Designer Rakhi Set\",\"rakhi with roli chawal\"],\"storefrontPricingApplied\":true,\"allowsAddons\":true}}],[\"$\",\"$L3f\",\"bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-set\",{\"product\":{\"categorySlug\":\"bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi\",\"seoTitle\":\"Bhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Set\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"inventory\":199,\"published\":true,\"slug\":\"bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-set\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-30T14:35:09.420Z\",\"GSI1SK\":\"PRODUCT#bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-set\",\"name\":\"Bhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Set\",\"unitsSold\":1,\"GSI1PK\":\"CATEGORY#bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi\",\"seoDescription\":\"Celebrate the beautiful bond of Raksha Bandhan with this stylish matching Bhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi set . Designed with elegance and attention to detail, this set per\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-03T09:37:20.297Z\",\"images\":[\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/2026/04/2-set-of-bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-1-e1775741213552.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/e00afdf7-130b-494a-83b6-8cf44e2d799a.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/2a60bb5e-da5e-4007-870e-be96705cf36e.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/2026/04/2-set-of-bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-1-e1775741213552.jpg\"],\"SK\":\"META\",\"compareAtPrice\":30,\"PK\":\"PRODUCT#bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-set\",\"description\":\"Celebrate the beautiful bond of Raksha Bandhan with this stylish matching Bhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi set . Designed with elegance and attention to detail, this set perfectly symbolizes love, respect, and togetherness. Perfect for choosing online rakhi , this set is ideal for sending your heartfelt emotions to your loved ones, even across distances. The Rakhi features a trendy and festive design, making it an excellent choice for both bhaiya and bhabhi. Crafted with high-quality materials and comfortable threads, it ensures a graceful look and ease of wear throughout the day. This Rakhi set also comes with traditional Roli and Chawal , completing your rituals with convenience. A perfect combination of tradition and modern style, this Bhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi set is a thoughtful gift to make your celebration even more special.\",\"price\":25.2,\"tags\":[\"couple rakhi set\",\"Rakhi Set for Brother and Bhabhi\"],\"storefrontPricingApplied\":true,\"allowsAddons\":true}}],\"$L66\",\"$L67\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"68:T13ae,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDoraemon Kids Rakhi with Assorted Chocolates\u003c/strong\u003e is a fun and colorful \u003cstrong\u003eKids Rakhi gift for brother\u003c/strong\u003e, specially designed to make Raksha Bandhan more exciting for younger brothers. Featuring a playful Doraemon-inspired centerpiece, colorful beads, and a traditional red and blue thread, this Rakhi combines a cheerful cartoon-inspired design with delicious assorted chocolates and traditional Roli Chawal. It is a thoughtful festive gift that brings together fun, sweetness, and the traditional spirit of Raksha Bandhan.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe centerpiece of this Rakhi features a cute \u003cstrong\u003eDoraemon-inspired design\u003c/strong\u003e that gives the Rakhi a playful and eye-catching appearance. The blue character detailing is beautifully complemented by colorful decorative beads, silver accents, and a traditional red and blue thread. The combination of bright colors and a fun character design makes this Rakhi especially appealing for kids and younger brothers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe Rakhi has a colorful and decorative design that adds a cheerful touch to the Raksha Bandhan celebration. The detailed centerpiece, vibrant beads, and traditional thread create a fun festive look that your little brother can proudly wear during the occasion. Its playful appearance makes it a lovely choice for sisters looking for a \u003cstrong\u003eDoraemon Rakhi for brother\u003c/strong\u003e or a colorful Kids Rakhi with chocolates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eTo make the celebration even sweeter, this Rakhi combo includes \u003cstrong\u003e5 assorted chocolate bars\u003c/strong\u003e. The chocolate treats add a delicious touch to the festive surprise and can be enjoyed by your brother and family during the Raksha Bandhan celebration. The combination of a fun Kids Rakhi and assorted chocolates makes this gift both exciting and enjoyable for children.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis combo also includes \u003cstrong\u003eRoli and Chawal\u003c/strong\u003e, traditional essentials used during the Raksha Bandhan ceremony. Roli is used for applying the traditional tilak, while Chawal (rice) is used as part of the traditional blessing ritual. These essentials make it convenient to perform the Rakhi ceremony while keeping the traditional customs of Raksha Bandhan at the heart of the celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's included in this Rakhi combo:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Doraemon Kids Rakhi\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5 Assorted Chocolate Bars\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Roli\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Chawal (Rice)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eEvery item listed above is included in this festive Raksha Bandhan gift combo, making it convenient to send a complete \u003cstrong\u003eKids Rakhi gift to your brother\u003c/strong\u003e. The colorful Doraemon-inspired Rakhi, assorted chocolate bars, and traditional Roli Chawal come together to create a cheerful combination of tradition and sweetness.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe bright blue, red, yellow, and silver details give this Rakhi a playful and festive appearance. The cartoon-inspired centerpiece adds a fun element that younger brothers are sure to enjoy, while the colorful beads and traditional thread keep the design connected to the traditional Raksha Bandhan celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eRaksha Bandhan is a special occasion to celebrate the loving bond between brothers and sisters. This Kids Rakhi combo makes the celebration even more memorable by combining a fun character-inspired Rakhi with delicious chocolate treats. Your brother can wear the Rakhi during the traditional ceremony and enjoy the chocolates as part of his festive surprise.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis \u003cstrong\u003eDoraemon Kids Rakhi with Assorted Chocolates\u003c/strong\u003e is also a convenient choice for sisters who want to send a complete Raksha Bandhan gift to their younger brother. The Rakhi, chocolates, Roli, and Chawal are brought together in one festive combination, making it easy to share your love and Raksha Bandhan wishes even when you are celebrating from a distance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIf your brother lives in the United States, this ready-to-gift \u003cstrong\u003eKids Rakhi combo for USA delivery\u003c/strong\u003e is a convenient way to send your festive wishes from far away. Instead of sending only a Rakhi, you can surprise your younger brother with a complete gift containing the colorful Kids Rakhi, assorted chocolates, Roli, and Chawal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you are celebrating Raksha Bandhan together or sending your love to your brother from another country, this \u003cstrong\u003eDoraemon Kids Rakhi with Assorted Chocolates\u003c/strong\u003e makes a cheerful and memorable festive gift. The playful Rakhi design, assorted chocolate treats, and traditional ceremony essentials come together to create a complete Raksha Bandhan surprise for your little brother.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eLooking for more options? Explore our \u003ca href=\"/kids-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eKids Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e collection for colorful and playful designs, browse our \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-combo-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Combos\u003c/a\u003e with chocolates, discover our \u003ca href=\"/single-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eSingle Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e designs, shop our \u003ca href=\"/bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Sets\u003c/a\u003e, or explore our complete \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-hampers-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Hampers\u003c/a\u003e for USA delivery.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"31:[\"$\",\"section\",\"kids-rakhi\",{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between mb-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-primary capitalize\",\"children\":\"Kids Rakhi To USA\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"href\":\"/kids-rakhi-to-usa\",\"className\":\"text-nav font-semibold text-sm hover:underline\",\"children\":\"View All →\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-5 gap-4 items-stretch\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3f\",\"bro-kids-rakhi-for-little-brother\",{\"product\":{\"seoTitle\":\"BRO Kids Rakhi for Little Brother\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"published\":true,\"lengthIn\":4,\"weightOz\":8,\"GSI1SK\":\"PRODUCT#bro-kids-rakhi-for-little-brother\",\"name\":\"BRO Kids Rakhi for Little Brother\",\"SK\":\"META\",\"tags\":[\"BRO Rakhi\",\"Buy Kids Rakhi Online\"],\"categorySlug\":\"kids-rakhi\",\"widthIn\":6,\"inventory\":199,\"slug\":\"bro-kids-rakhi-for-little-brother\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-30T14:35:09.420Z\",\"unitsSold\":1,\"he