rakhi\",\"seoDescription\":\"Celebrate the beautiful bond of love and protection with this Traditional Multicolor Rakhi with Roli Chawal Set , specially designed for joyful Raksha Bandhan c\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-01T16:39:57.559037Z\",\"images\":[\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/2026/05/pink-multi-stone-rakhi-to-usa.jpeg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/e673a2ac-fb9a-40d5-bda8-5b6460bde24d.jpeg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/2cb2f456-5e4a-4aa5-ab94-43e200cdd28b.jpeg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/bba5c361-2a8c-4be4-9006-2c02f28bf7b4.jpeg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/2026/05/pink-multi-stone-rakhi-to-usa.jpeg\"],\"SK\":\"META\",\"compareAtPrice\":25,\"PK\":\"PRODUCT#single-rakhi-with-roli-chawal-for-brother\",\"description\":\"Celebrate the beautiful bond of love and protection with this Traditional Multicolor Rakhi with Roli Chawal Set , specially designed for joyful Raksha Bandhan celebrations. This elegant multicolor rakhi for men symbolizes affection, blessings, and lifelong togetherness, making it a perfect choice for your beloved brother. The combo includes a beautifully crafted rakhi along with sacred Roli (Kumkum) and Chawal (Rice) , essential for performing the traditional Raksha Bandhan tilak ritual. Designed with vibrant colors and festive detailing, this rakhi combo with roli chawal adds charm, tradition, and emotional value to your celebration. Whether celebrating together or across miles, this festive combo is perfect to send rakhi to USA and make your brother feel special with your love and blessings. A thoughtful choice for those looking for online rakhi delivery USA , traditional rakhi for brother , and a stylish multicolor rakhi combo .\",\"price\":16.56,\"sku\":\"RK-22\",\"tags\":[],\"storefrontPricingApplied\":true,\"allowsAddons\":true}}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"51:[\"$\",\"$L3f\",\"pearl-single-rakhi\",{\"product\":\"$48:props:product\"}]\n7c:T14ce,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Designer Rakhi Set with Blue Stone and Om Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e is a beautiful and traditional \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi gift set for Brother\u003c/strong\u003e, featuring four uniquely designed Rakhis in an elegant combination of blue, gold, yellow, pink, and pearl-style detailing. This festive Raksha Bandhan collection brings together sophisticated stonework and traditional Om-inspired designs, making it a thoughtful choice for celebrating the special bond between brothers and sisters.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis Rakhi set includes \u003cstrong\u003etwo elegant blue stone Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e designed with beautiful light-blue beads, pearl-style accents, golden separators, and sparkling deep-blue centerpiece stones. The round blue stones are surrounded by intricate crystal-style detailing, creating a rich and eye-catching appearance. The combination of blue beads, gold-toned elements, and pearl-style accents gives these Rakhis a premium and festive look.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe set also features \u003cstrong\u003etwo traditional Om Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e with beautifully detailed golden Om medallions surrounded by small pearl-style beads. One Rakhi is designed with a yellow thread and yellow beads, while the other features a pink thread with colorful red and yellow bead accents. The golden Om centerpiece adds a spiritual and traditional touch, making these Rakhis especially meaningful for Raksha Bandhan celebrations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe four Rakhis offer different styles within one collection, allowing you to choose a design according to your brother's personality and preference. The blue stone Rakhis have a modern and sophisticated appearance, while the Om Rakhis beautifully represent traditional Indian symbolism. Together, they create a versatile Rakhi collection for family celebrations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe detailed beadwork on each Rakhi gives the set a festive and elegant appearance. The blue Rakhis combine translucent blue beads with pearl-style beads, golden separators, and sparkling blue stones. The Om Rakhis combine golden elements, pearl-style borders, colorful beads, and decorative threadwork to create a traditional yet stylish design.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis Rakhi set also includes \u003cstrong\u003eRoli and Chawal\u003c/strong\u003e, traditional essentials used during the Raksha Bandhan ceremony. Roli is used to apply the auspicious tilak on the brother's forehead, while Chawal (rice) is placed as part of the traditional blessing ritual. These ceremony essentials make the Rakhi set convenient for celebrating the festival with traditional customs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's included in this Rakhi set:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Blue Stone Designer Rakhis\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Traditional Om Rakhis\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Roli\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Chawal (Rice)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eEvery item listed above is included in this Raksha Bandhan gift set. The four different Rakhi designs provide a beautiful variety of styles, while the Roli and Chawal complete the traditional Rakhi ceremony essentials.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eblue stone Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e feature carefully arranged light-blue beads, pearl-style beads, golden accents, and prominent deep-blue stones surrounded by sparkling decorative detailing. Their rich color combination gives them an elegant appearance suitable for brothers who prefer modern and premium Rakhi designs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eOm Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e feature a detailed golden Om symbol as the centerpiece, surrounded by pearl-style detailing. The yellow and pink threads add vibrant festive colors, while the decorative beads and golden separators enhance the traditional look. The Om symbol adds a meaningful spiritual element to the Rakhi design.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith four different Rakhis included, this collection is suitable for celebrating Raksha Bandhan with brothers of different ages or for families looking for multiple Rakhi designs in one set. The variety of blue stone and Om designs makes the collection both stylish and traditional.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eRaksha Bandhan is a special festival that celebrates the love, protection, and lifelong connection between brothers and sisters. A beautifully designed Rakhi is an important part of this celebration, and this collection brings together elegant craftsmanship, traditional symbolism, and festive colors to make the occasion memorable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIf your brother lives in the United States, this \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi gift set for USA delivery\u003c/strong\u003e offers a convenient way to send your love and Raksha Bandhan wishes from a distance. The Rakhis and traditional Roli Chawal are packed together as a festive gift, making it easy to celebrate the Rakhi ceremony even when you cannot be together in person.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you are looking for a traditional Om Rakhi, an elegant blue stone Rakhi, or a multi-Rakhi gift set, this collection offers a combination of designs in one package. The detailed beadwork, golden accents, colorful threads, and traditional motifs make it a beautiful addition to your Raksha Bandhan celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eLooking for more options? Explore our \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-combo-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Combos\u003c/a\u003e, discover our \u003ca href=\"/single-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eSingle Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e designs, explore our \u003ca href=\"/kids-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eKids Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e collection, browse our \u003ca href=\"/bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Sets\u003c/a\u003e, or shop our complete \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-hampers-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Hampers\u003c/a\u003e for USA delivery.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"53:[\"$\",\"$L3f\",\"blue-sapphire-pearl-ek-omkar-rakhi-set-combo-spiritual-designer-rakhi\",{\"product\":{\"categorySlug\":\"rakhi-combo\",\"widthIn\":6,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"inventory\":196,\"published\":true,\"lengthIn\":8,\"slug\":\"blue-sapphire-pearl-ek-omkar-rakhi-set-combo-spiritual-designer-rakhi\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-15T10:36:32.454Z\",\"weightOz\":4,\"GSI1SK\":\"PRODUCT#blue-sapphire-pearl-ek-omkar-rakhi-set-combo-spiritual-designer-rakhi\",\"name\":\"Blue Sapphire Pearl \u0026 Ek Omkar Rakhi Set of 4| Spiritual Designer Rakhi\",\"unitsSold\":4,\"heightIn\":1,\"storefrontPricingApplied\":true,\"GSI1PK\":\"CATEGORY#rakhi-combo\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-16T16:13:30.186Z\",\"images\":[\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/blue-sapphire-pearl-ek-omkar-rakhi-set-combo-spiritual-designer-rakhi/10147f9a-afab-4bb6-8779-fb671ee97960.png\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/blue-sapphire-pearl-ek-omkar-rakhi-set-combo-spiritual-designer-rakhi/2b9f10ae-5e7f-494a-a4c0-b492b0ea5b19.png\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/blue-sapphire-pearl-ek-omkar-rakhi-set-combo-spiritual-designer-rakhi/a40bec01-47c8-4cff-8707-29ec7457745f.png\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/blue-sapphire-pearl-ek-omkar-rakhi-set-combo-spiritual-designer-rakhi/8be4aa86-46c8-4ffa-81f7-b22e8561362d.png\"],\"SK\":\"META\",\"compareAtPrice\":38,\"PK\":\"PRODUCT#blue-sapphire-pearl-ek-omkar-rakhi-set-combo-spiritual-designer-rakhi\",\"description\":\"$7c\",\"price\":25,\"sku\":\"RC-BSPEO-001\",\"tags\":[\"rakhi\",\"rakhi combo\",\"blue sapphire rakhi\",\"ek onkar rakhi\",\"pearl rakhi\",\"designer rakhi\",\"brother rakhi\",\"premium rakhi\",\"handcrafted rakhi\",\"raksha bandhan\",\"indian festival\",\"send rakhi to usa\",\"rakhi usa\",\"festive gift\",\"spiritual rakhi\"],\"allowsAddons