":\"CATEGORY#rakhi-combo\",\"seoDescription\":\"Celebrate the sacred bond of love this Raksha Bandhan with our Festive Om Shree Rakhi \u0026 Chocolate Gift Set. Designed with spiritual Om and Shree symbols, this e\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-01T16:39:57.559037Z\",\"images\":[\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/2026/03/Festive-Om-Shree-Rakhi-Chocolate-Gift-Set-1-e1779538390938.webp\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/01c5702c-e04c-44fb-a429-91e32ff5a38a.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/aa9cbcc0-cfeb-4f00-a0dd-230938e2ed1f.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/2026/03/Festive-Om-Shree-Rakhi-Chocolate-Gift-Set-1-e1779538390938.webp\"],\"SK\":\"META\",\"compareAtPrice\":41,\"PK\":\"PRODUCT#festive-om-shree-rakhi-chocolate-gift-set\",\"description\":\"Celebrate the sacred bond of love this Raksha Bandhan with our Festive Om Shree Rakhi \u0026 Chocolate Gift Set. Designed with spiritual Om and Shree symbols, this elegant Om Rakhi represents positivity, blessings, and prosperity for your beloved brother. Paired with delicious chocolates, this festive combo adds sweetness to your Raksha Bandhan celebrations. It is a perfect gift choice to express your love and send heartfelt wishes to brothers living abroad. Send Om Rakhi to USA online and make your brother feel special no matter the distance. Crafted with care using premium-quality materials, this designer Om Rakhi offers a traditional yet stylish look suitable for all age groups. The divine design enhances the festive spirit and becomes a memorable keepsake for your brother. Buy Om Rakhi online for USA and celebrate Raksha Bandhan with love, tradition, and sweetness. This Rakhi with chocolates combo comes with complimentary Roli \u0026 Chawal, making it a complete festive gift for your brother in the USA.\",\"price\":24.3,\"tags\":[\"om shree rakh\",\"rakhi combo\",\"Rakhi with Chocolates\",\"rakhi with roli chawal\",\"Spiritual Rakhi\"],\"storefrontPricingApplied\":true,\"allowsAddons\":true}}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"7f:T12fc,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElegant Triple Stone Rakhi with Lindor Chocolates\u003c/strong\u003e is a beautiful and festive \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi gift combo for Brother\u003c/strong\u003e, thoughtfully designed to combine an elegant stone-studded Rakhi, a beaded designer Rakhi, assorted chocolates, and traditional Raksha Bandhan essentials. This gift combo brings together traditional charm, stylish detailing, and a sweet festive treat for a memorable celebration.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe set features \u003cstrong\u003etwo beautifully designed Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e, each with its own distinctive style. The first Rakhi showcases three elegant floral-style stone centerpieces with intricate golden detailing, while the second Rakhi features pearl-style beads and colorful decorative accents for a graceful and sophisticated appearance.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003etriple stone designer Rakhi\u003c/strong\u003e features three round floral-shaped centerpieces decorated with sparkling stone-style detailing. Golden beads are arranged around the centerpieces, creating a rich and elegant appearance. The red thread adds a vibrant traditional touch and complements the golden design beautifully.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003epearl and bead Rakhi\u003c/strong\u003e features a peach-colored thread decorated with white pearl-style beads, golden separators, and colorful decorative accents. The combination of pearls and detailed beadwork gives this Rakhi a soft and elegant festive look.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eAlong with the two designer Rakhis, this gift combo includes \u003cstrong\u003eassorted Lindor chocolates\u003c/strong\u003e in colorful wrappers. The red, blue, yellow, and orange chocolates add a cheerful and indulgent touch to the Raksha Bandhan celebration, making the combination perfect for gifting.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe combination of two different designer Rakhis and assorted chocolates makes this a convenient \u003cstrong\u003eready-to-gift Raksha Bandhan combo\u003c/strong\u003e. The elegant stonework and bead detailing add sophistication to the Rakhis, while the chocolates bring sweetness and joy to the celebration.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThis Rakhi gift combo also includes \u003cstrong\u003eRoli and Chawal\u003c/strong\u003e, traditional essentials used during the Raksha Bandhan ceremony. Roli is used to apply the auspicious tilak on the brother's forehead, while Chawal (rice) is used as part of the traditional blessing ritual.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's included in this Rakhi gift combo:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e1 Triple Stone Designer Rakhi with Red Thread\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e1 Pearl and Beaded Designer Rakhi\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eAssorted Lindor Chocolates\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Roli\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Chawal (Rice)\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003eEvery item listed above is included in this festive Raksha Bandhan gift combo. The two designer Rakhis provide variety, the assorted chocolates add a sweet festive treat, and the Roli Chawal complete the traditional ceremony essentials.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe detailed floral-style stone centerpieces on the first Rakhi give it a premium festive appearance. The sparkling stone detailing, golden beads, and red thread create an attractive combination that is perfect for a traditional Raksha Bandhan celebration.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe second Rakhi adds variety with its \u003cstrong\u003epearl-style beadwork and colorful decorative accents\u003c/strong\u003e. Its peach-colored thread and elegant bead arrangement create a softer look while maintaining the festive character of the complete set.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe assorted Lindor chocolates complement both Rakhis and add an indulgent touch to the complete gift. Their individually wrapped presentation makes them easy to enjoy and gives the Raksha Bandhan gift a colorful and cheerful appearance.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eRaksha Bandhan is a special occasion to celebrate the love, affection, and lifelong bond between brothers and sisters. This \u003cstrong\u003eElegant Triple Stone Rakhi with Lindor Chocolates\u003c/strong\u003e provides a thoughtful way to express your love and festive wishes through beautiful Rakhis, chocolates, and traditional ceremony essentials.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eIf your brother lives in the United States, this \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi gift combo for USA delivery\u003c/strong\u003e offers a convenient way to send your Raksha Bandhan wishes from a distance. The Rakhis, chocolates, Roli, and Chawal are included together, making it easy to send a complete festive gift without purchasing the items separately.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eWhether you are looking for a stone-studded Rakhi, a designer Rakhi set with chocolates, a pearl Rakhi, or a complete Raksha Bandhan gift for your brother, this combination offers a beautiful balance of elegance, sweetness, and tradition.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eLooking for more options? Explore our \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-combo-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Combos\u003c/a\u003e, discover our \u003ca href=\"/single-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eSingle Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e designs, explore our \u003ca href=\"/kids-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eKids Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e collection, browse our \u003ca href=\"/bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Sets\u003c/a\u003e, or shop our complete \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-hampers-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Hampers\u003c/a\u003e for USA delivery.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"58:[\"$\",\"$L3f\",\"men-rakhi-set-of-2-with-chocolates-combo\",{\"product\":{\"categorySlug\":\"rakhi-combo\",\"seoTitle\":\"Men Rakhi Set of 2 with Chocolates Combo\",\"wid