4-pack-delight\",{\"product\":{\"seoTitle\":\"Send Festive Rakhi 4 Pack Delight to USA | Free Shipping | Rakhi Hamper\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"published\":true,\"lengthIn\":10,\"weightOz\":32,\"GSI1SK\":\"PRODUCT#festive-rakhi-4-pack-delight\",\"name\":\"Set of 4 Kids Designer Rakhis with Kaju Katli, Cashews \u0026 Pistachios Gift Hamper for Brother | Premium Raksha Bandhan Gift Set\",\"storefrontPricingApplied\":true,\"SK\":\"META\",\"tags\":[\"rakhi-hamper\",\"gift-hamper\",\"raksha-bandhan\",\"dry-fruits\",\"send-rakhi-to-usa\"],\"categorySlug\":\"rakhi-hampers\",\"widthIn\":8,\"inventory\":500,\"slug\":\"festive-rakhi-4-pack-delight\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-16T18:14:20.205Z\",\"heightIn\":4,\"GSI1PK\":\"CATEGORY#rakhi-hampers\",\"seoDescription\":\"Send Festive Rakhi 4 Pack Delight to USA — Rakhi hamper gift box with Set of 4 Rakhi, 200 g Kaju Katli, 100 g cashews, 100 g pistachios.\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-25T18:46:07.488Z\",\"images\":[\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/orange-county/TFUSRH2026-31/TFUSRH2026-31.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/orange-county/TFUSRH2026-31/TFUSRH2026-31a.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/orange-county/TFUSRH2026-31/TFUSRH2026-31b.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/orange-county/TFUSRH2026-31/TFUSRH2026-31c.jpg\"],\"compareAtPrice\":81.25,\"PK\":\"PRODUCT#festive-rakhi-4-pack-delight\",\"description\":\"$86\",\"price\":65,\"sku\":\"TFUSRH2026-31\",\"allowsAddons\":false}}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"87:T1575,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTraditional Rakhi Combo with Premium Dry Fruits and Traditional Sweets\u003c/strong\u003e is a beautiful and festive \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi gift combo for Brother\u003c/strong\u003e, thoughtfully designed to combine traditional Raksha Bandhan charm with premium dry fruits and delicious Indian sweets. This gift set features \u003cstrong\u003e2 traditional designer Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e with elegant golden bead detailing and vibrant red threads, paired with \u003cstrong\u003ealmonds, cashews, and traditional sweets\u003c/strong\u003e for a wholesome and memorable Raksha Bandhan celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe Rakhi set features \u003cstrong\u003e2 beautifully designed traditional Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e decorated with intricate golden beads, pearl-style accents, decorative stones, and vibrant red threads. The detailed beadwork gives the Rakhis an elegant and festive appearance, making them a meaningful choice for celebrating the special bond between brother and sister.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003etraditional designer Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e combine classic Indian Raksha Bandhan elements with decorative golden detailing. The carefully arranged beads and vibrant red threads create a graceful festive look, making these Rakhis suitable for brothers who appreciate traditional and elegant Rakhi designs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAlong with the Rakhis, this gift combo includes a selection of \u003cstrong\u003epremium dry fruits, including almonds and cashews\u003c/strong\u003e. The crunchy dry fruits add a nutritious and wholesome element to the festive gift, making the combination both delicious and thoughtful.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe gift also includes \u003cstrong\u003etraditional Indian sweets\u003c/strong\u003e, adding a delightful touch of sweetness to the Raksha Bandhan celebration. The colorful sweet treats complement the dry fruits and Rakhis beautifully, creating a festive combination that your brother can enjoy during the celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe combination of \u003cstrong\u003e2 Traditional Designer Rakhis, Premium Almonds, Cashews, and Traditional Sweets\u003c/strong\u003e makes this a convenient \u003cstrong\u003eready-to-gift Raksha Bandhan combo\u003c/strong\u003e. It brings together traditional Rakhis, nutritious dry fruits, and festive sweets in one attractive gift, making it a thoughtful way to express love and appreciation to your brother.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis Rakhi gift combo also includes \u003cstrong\u003eRoli and Chawal\u003c/strong\u003e, traditional essentials used during the Raksha Bandhan ceremony. Roli is used to apply the auspicious tilak on the brother's forehead, while Chawal (rice) is used as part of the traditional blessing ritual. These essentials make it convenient to complete the traditional Rakhi ceremony along with the gift.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's included in this Rakhi gift combo:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Traditional Designer Rakhis\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Almonds\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Cashews\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTraditional Indian Sweets\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Roli\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Chawal (Rice)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eEvery item listed above is included in this festive Raksha Bandhan gift combo. The elegant Rakhis add traditional charm, the \u003cstrong\u003ealmonds and cashews\u003c/strong\u003e provide a wholesome snack, and the traditional sweets add a delicious festive touch to the complete gift.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe Rakhis feature a beautiful combination of \u003cstrong\u003ered threads, golden beads, pearl-style accents, and decorative detailing\u003c/strong\u003e. Their traditional styling gives the gift a graceful and festive appearance while keeping the spirit of Raksha Bandhan at the heart of the design.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003epremium dry fruits\u003c/strong\u003e add a nutritious and satisfying element to the Rakhi gift. Almonds and cashews are popular festive treats and complement the traditional sweets beautifully, creating a balanced combination of wholesome snacking and celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003etraditional Indian sweets\u003c/strong\u003e add an extra touch of sweetness and festivity to the gift. Their colorful presentation makes the complete Rakhi combo attractive and suitable for sharing and enjoying during the Raksha Bandhan celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eRaksha Bandhan is a special occasion to celebrate the love, affection, and lifelong bond between brothers and sisters. This \u003cstrong\u003eTraditional Rakhi Combo with Premium Dry Fruits and Traditional Sweets\u003c/strong\u003e provides a thoughtful way to express your love and festive wishes through beautiful Rakhis, delicious sweets, premium dry fruits, and traditional ceremony essentials.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIf your brother lives in the United States, this \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi gift combo for USA delivery\u003c/strong\u003e offers a convenient way to send your Raksha Bandhan wishes from a distance. The 2 Rakhis, almonds, cashews, traditional sweets, Roli, and Chawal are included together, making it easy to send a complete festive gift without purchasing the items separately.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you are looking for a \u003cstrong\u003etraditional Rakhi with dry fruits, Rakhi with sweets, a designer Rakhi combo, or a complete Raksha Bandhan gift for your brother\u003c/strong\u003e, this combination offers a beautiful balance of tradition, sweetness, and wholesome treats. The elegant Rakhis, premium dry fruits, traditional sweets, and Roli Chawal make it a memorable festive gift.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eLooking for more options? Explore our \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-combo-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Combos\u003c/a\u003e, discover our \u003ca href=\"/single-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eSingle Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e designs, explore our \u003ca href=\"/kids-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eKids Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e collection, browse our \u003ca href=\"/bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Sets\u003c/a\u003e, or shop our complete \u003ca href=\"/r