cript>self.__next_f.push([1,"89:T1413,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTraditional Rakhi Combo with 3 Ferrero Chocolates and Premium Dry Fruits\u003c/strong\u003e is a beautiful and festive \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi gift combo for Brother\u003c/strong\u003e, thoughtfully designed to combine traditional Raksha Bandhan charm with premium chocolates and delicious dry fruits. This gift set features \u003cstrong\u003e2 traditional designer Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e with colorful threads and decorative beadwork, paired with \u003cstrong\u003e3 Ferrero chocolates and premium almonds\u003c/strong\u003e for a sweet and memorable celebration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe Rakhi set features \u003cstrong\u003e2 beautifully designed traditional Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e decorated with colorful red, green, and yellow threads, golden beads, pearl-style accents, and decorative centerpieces. The vibrant colors and intricate beadwork give the Rakhis a festive and traditional appearance, making them a lovely choice for celebrating the special bond between brother and sister.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003edesigner Rakhis\u003c/strong\u003e combine traditional Indian Raksha Bandhan elements with colorful decorative detailing. The carefully arranged beads, golden accents, and vibrant threads create an elegant festive look, making these Rakhis suitable for brothers of different ages.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAlong with the Rakhis, this gift combo includes \u003cstrong\u003e3 Ferrero chocolates\u003c/strong\u003e, offering a premium and indulgent sweet treat for your brother. The individually wrapped chocolates are presented in an elegant gift box and add a luxurious touch to the complete Raksha Bandhan gift.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis Rakhi combo also includes \u003cstrong\u003epremium almonds\u003c/strong\u003e, adding a wholesome and nutritious element to the festive gift. The crunchy dry fruits complement the chocolates beautifully, creating a thoughtful combination of traditional celebration, premium sweets, and healthy snacking.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe combination of \u003cstrong\u003e2 Designer Rakhis, 3 Ferrero Chocolates, and Premium Almonds\u003c/strong\u003e makes this a convenient \u003cstrong\u003eready-to-gift Raksha Bandhan combo\u003c/strong\u003e. It brings together traditional Rakhis, premium chocolates, and dry fruits in one attractive festive gift, making it a thoughtful way to express love and appreciation to your brother.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis Rakhi gift combo also includes \u003cstrong\u003eRoli and Chawal\u003c/strong\u003e, traditional essentials used during the Raksha Bandhan ceremony. Roli is used to apply the auspicious tilak on the brother's forehead, while Chawal (rice) is used as part of the traditional blessing ritual. These essentials make it convenient to complete the traditional Rakhi ceremony along with the gift.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's included in this Rakhi gift combo:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Traditional Designer Rakhis\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 Ferrero Chocolates\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Almonds\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Roli\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Small Packet of Chawal (Rice)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eEvery item listed above is included in this festive Raksha Bandhan gift combo. The colorful designer Rakhis add traditional charm, the \u003cstrong\u003e3 Ferrero chocolates\u003c/strong\u003e provide a premium sweet treat, and the almonds add a wholesome touch to the complete gift.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe Rakhis feature a beautiful combination of \u003cstrong\u003ecolorful threads, golden beads, pearl-style accents, and traditional decorative elements\u003c/strong\u003e. Their vibrant styling gives the gift a cheerful and festive appearance while maintaining the traditional spirit of Raksha Bandhan.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e3 Ferrero chocolates\u003c/strong\u003e add an elegant and indulgent element to the Rakhi gift. Their premium presentation makes the combo feel special and festive, while the almonds provide a delicious crunchy snack that complements the chocolates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eRaksha Bandhan is a special occasion to celebrate the love, affection, and lifelong bond between brothers and sisters. This \u003cstrong\u003eTraditional Rakhi Combo with 3 Ferrero Chocolates and Premium Dry Fruits\u003c/strong\u003e provides a thoughtful way to express your love and festive wishes through beautiful Rakhis, premium chocolates, dry fruits, and traditional ceremony essentials.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIf your brother lives in the United States, this \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi gift combo for USA delivery\u003c/strong\u003e offers a convenient way to send your Raksha Bandhan wishes from a distance. The 2 Rakhis, 3 Ferrero chocolates, almonds, Roli, and Chawal are included together, making it easy to send a complete festive gift without purchasing the items separately.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you are looking for a \u003cstrong\u003etraditional Rakhi with chocolates, Rakhi with dry fruits, designer Rakhi combo, or a complete Raksha Bandhan gift for your brother\u003c/strong\u003e, this combination offers a beautiful balance of tradition, sweetness, and wholesome treats. The colorful Rakhis, premium chocolates, almonds, and traditional Roli Chawal make it a memorable festive gift.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eLooking for more options? Explore our \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-combo-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Combos\u003c/a\u003e, discover our \u003ca href=\"/single-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eSingle Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e designs, explore our \u003ca href=\"/kids-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eKids Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e collection, browse our \u003ca href=\"/bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi Rakhi Sets\u003c/a\u003e, or shop our complete \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-hampers-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Hampers\u003c/a\u003e for USA delivery.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"64:[\"$\",\"$L3f\",\"treat-my-brother-hamper\",{\"product\":{\"seoTitle\":\"Send Treat My Brother Hamper to USA | Free Shipping | Rakhi Hamper\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"published\":true,\"lengthIn\":10,\"weightOz\":32,\"GSI1SK\":\"PRODUCT#treat-my-brother-hamper\",\"name\":\"Set of 2 Personalized Brother Name Rakhis with Kaju Katli, Ferrero Rocher \u0026 Almonds Gift Hamper\",\"storefrontPricingApplied\":true,\"SK\":\"META\",\"tags\":[\"rakhi-hamper\",\"gift-hamper\",\"raksha-bandhan\",\"dry-fruits\",\"send-rakhi-to-usa\"],\"additionalCategorySlugs\":[\"rakhi-combo\"],\"categorySlug\":\"rakhi-hampers\",\"widthIn\":8,\"inventory\":500,\"slug\":\"treat-my-brother-hamper\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-16T18:14:20.205Z\",\"heightIn\":4,\"GSI1PK\":\"CATEGORY#rakhi-hampers\",\"seoDescription\":\"Send Treat My Brother Hamper to USA — Rakhi hamper gift box with Pair of 2 beaded Rakhis, Gms kaju katli,, Gms almonds, Pcs.\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-16T18:01:23.539Z\",\"images\":[\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/uploads/orange-county/TFCOM007/TFCOM007.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/treat-my-brother-hamper/f5aa0746-860f-4cba-9bec-aafc7108d2e4.jpg\",\"https://d301af4ndyn9qx.cloudfront.net/products/treat-my-brother-hamper/69329d38-3008-48b3-b1de-c4f83a24edad.jpg\"],\"compareAtPrice\":99.88,\"PK\":\"PRODUCT#treat-my-brother-hamper\",\"description\":\"$89\",\"price\":79.9,\"sku\":\"TFCOM007\",\"allowsAddons\":false}}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"8a:T77a,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThink of me Rakhi Hamper\u003c/strong\u003e is a premium \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi hamper\u003c/strong\u003e for USA delivery. Sisters in India, the UK, Canada, and worldwide order this festive gift box so brothers across America receive designer rakhis with traditional sweets and dry fruits — shipped domestically within the United States for reliable Raksha Bandhan delivery.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnlike a simple thread-only gift, this hamper turns Raksha Bandhan into a full celebration: sweets for the family, dry fruits for sharing, and roli chawal or tilak essentials where listed. Ideal if you searched for a \u003cstrong\u003erakhi gift hamper\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003erakhi with dry fruits\u003c/strong\u003e, or a ready-to-gift \u003cstrong\u003eRakhi mithai box USA\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's included in this hamper:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eSet of 2 designer Rakhis\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e100 g cashews\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e100 g pistachios\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e100 g almonds\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery item above ships together in one gift hamper — quantities are as listed (grams / pieces). Perfect when you want to \u003cstrong\u003esend a Rakhi gift hamper to USA\u003c/strong\u003e without buying sweets separately.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy sisters choose this hamper for USA delivery:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eClear what's-included list with quantities\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDomestic USA shipping — no international customs delay for your brother\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFestive packaging ready for Raksha Bandhan 2026\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSecure checkout in USD (Stripe) or INR (Razorpay)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLooking for more options? Browse our \u003ca href=\"/rakhi-combo-to-usa\"\u003eRakhi Combos\u003c/a\u003e with chocolates, \u003ca href=\"/single-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eSingle Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e designs, \u003ca href=\"/kids-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eKids Rakhi\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/bhaiya-bhabhi-rakhi-to-usa\"\u003eBhaiya Bhabhi sets\u003c/a\u003e, or sho